{"approved":false,"back_sample":null,"beam_size":2,"checks":{"no_residual_markers":true,"nonempty":true,"not_truncated":true,"protected_values":true,"translated":true},"context":"dominoes-game UI copy.howAnswer","detected_language":"sw","format":"usefulverse-background-draft-v1","key":"dominoes-game.copy.howAnswer","keys":["dominoes-game.copy.howAnswer"],"locale":"ha","model":"google/madlad400-3b-mt","raw_translation":"Duk mai bugawa yana samun kwallaye bakwai. Mafi girman biyu a kowace hannun zai buɗe; idan babu hannun da ke da biyu, mafi girman darajar kwallaye zai buɗe. Haɗa ƙarshen ɗaya daga cikin kwallaye zuwa ɗayan ƙarshen da aka buɗe na layin. A cikin yanayin kwafa, karɓi kwallaye daga ajiye har sai ka iya wasa ko kuma ya zama baƙi. A cikin yanayin ƙofar, ba da lokacin da ba ka iya wasa. Taron na ƙarshe idan hannun ya zama baƙi ko kuma ba wani mai bugawa zai iya motsa; mai bugawa da mafi ƙarancin pips da ya rage yana lashe taron ƙofar.","record_id":"103b1634391198bcb5e8847ee9c0c7023b19e55a0123f71971bb4dd077084839","revision":"fa184c675da0b5c9e1c8694fccd4e12e2d422094","run_id":"41028627586","seconds":2.344339390375012,"source":"Each player gets seven tiles. The highest double in either hand opens; if neither hand has a double, the highest-value tile opens. Match one end of a tile to either open end of the line. In draw mode, take tiles from the stock until you can play or it is empty. In block mode, pass when you cannot play. The round ends when a hand is empty or neither player can move; the player with fewer remaining pips wins a blocked round.","source_commit":"0795f2ac94fd96942ab121fbeaaccf7766f584d4","source_hash":"503d37a4f04108ef5df451bfef0e607d4100574507692324173c011fa2628f65","status":"needs-review","translation":"Duk mai bugawa yana samun kwallaye bakwai. Mafi girman biyu a kowace hannun zai buɗe; idan babu hannun da ke da biyu, mafi girman darajar kwallaye zai buɗe. Haɗa ƙarshen ɗaya daga cikin kwallaye zuwa ɗayan ƙarshen da aka buɗe na layin. A cik